      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently commend the neurology specialists, including Dr. Moore, Dr. Parker, Dr. Stainback, and Dr. Knowles, for their deep expertise and reassuring bedside manner. Reviewers appreciate that the doctors and veterinary technicians answer technical questions thoroughly and treat vulnerable pets with extraordinary care."
