      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive care for neurological patients"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners emphasize the loving, supportive attention provided to dogs suffering from acute paralysis, spinal trauma, and chronic seizure conditions. Reviewers note that staff handle fragile patients with immense gentleness, reducing anxiety during diagnostic scans and lengthy postoperative recoveries."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful spinal surgeries and rehabilitation"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report life-changing surgical and medical outcomes, particularly for dogs affected by herniated discs, IVDD, brain tumours, and autoimmune encephalitis. Multiple owners share that prompt surgical interventions restored their pets' motor mobility and allowed paralyzed dogs to walk again."
      }
    }
